# Settings and Books are tabs on the bar, not also tiles, so the first page
# of the grid reaches Daily Brief. The pages turn both ways.
wait-for Cobalt
expect App Store
expect Terminal
expect Daily Brief
wait-for 1 of
shot launcher-home
tap-id next
wait-for 2 of
tap-id previous
wait-for 1 of
# A Store app's starting screen says what it reaches for in words.
tap Daily Brief
wait-for Starting
expect Connects to online services
expect-missing Uses network
shot launcher-starting-brief
tap Back
wait-for Cobalt
